# Lesson 1 - making the computer talk
#
# Run this file with:     bolo learn\01_say.bolo
#
# "say" means "show this on the screen".
# Text goes inside quotes. Numbers do not need quotes.

say("Hello!")
say("I am a program. I do exactly what these lines tell me.")
say("")
say(42)
say("The answer to 6 times 7 is...")
say(6 * 7)

# Lines that start with # are notes for humans.
# The computer skips them completely. So this line does nothing.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
